# Images Directory

This directory is reserved for storing image assets for the portfolio website.

## Recommended Image Structure:

```
images/
├── profile/
│   ├── headshot.jpg           # Professional headshot for about page
│   └── casual.jpg             # Casual photo for home page
├── projects/
│   ├── project1-screenshot.png
│   ├── project2-screenshot.png
│   └── project3-screenshot.png
├── skills/
│   ├── tech-icons/            # Technology logos and icons
│   └── certifications/        # Certificate images
└── misc/
    ├── background.jpg         # Hero background image
    └── logo.png              # Personal logo/brand
```

## Image Optimization Guidelines:

### File Formats:
- **JPEG** for photographs and complex images
- **PNG** for images with transparency or simple graphics
- **SVG** for icons and vector graphics
- **WebP** for modern browsers (optional optimization)

### Recommended Sizes:
- **Profile photos**: 400x400px (square crop)
- **Project screenshots**: 1200x800px (3:2 aspect ratio)
- **Hero backgrounds**: 1920x1080px (16:9 aspect ratio)
- **Icons**: 64x64px or vector (SVG)

### Optimization:
- Compress images to reduce file size
- Use appropriate quality settings (80-90% for JPEG)
- Consider lazy loading for performance
- Provide alt text for accessibility

## Usage in HTML:

```html
<!-- Profile image example -->
<img src="images/profile/headshot.jpg" 
     alt="Jayson - Professional headshot" 
     class="w-32 h-32 rounded-full object-cover">

<!-- Project screenshot example -->
<img src="images/projects/project1-screenshot.png" 
     alt="DeFi Trading Platform Screenshot" 
     class="w-full h-48 object-cover rounded-lg">
```

## Current Status:
